ve the Odds:</i></strong> In this world, search for limited-use health and gauntlet energy pools to fight back and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Multiple Fight Methods:</i></strong> Close combat is not your only option. Use traps and other destructible environment objects to battle and defeat your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/bd45c5a050c07ccff95e6b58afa7ba88.poster.avif?t=1754610964\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/bd45c5a050c07ccff95e6b58afa7ba88.webm?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/bd45c5a050c07ccff95e6b58afa7ba88.mp4?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dynamic Enemies Count and Difficulty:</strong></i> Encounter and overcome common enemies, or discover tougher hidden foes and bosses that will test your skills and offer rewards or penalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/f2f6ca8957308ab67193ad7cf1b8d6a1.poster.avif?t=1754610964\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/f2f6ca8957308ab67193ad7cf1b8d6a1.webm?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/f2f6ca8957308ab67193ad7cf1b8d6a1.mp4?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Boss Fights:</i></strong> Encounter epic-scale bosses and some Secret, sub-optional ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/3d0b1148cd2dd09e3e3c099176295fcf.poster.avif?t=1754610964\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/3d0b1148cd2dd09e3e3c099176295fcf.webm?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/3d0b1148cd2dd09e3e3c099176295fcf.mp4?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Secret Gauntlet Parts and Player Upgrades:</i></strong> Discover how to unlock the Gauntlet's full potential and obtain player upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lead the Fallen Guardians:</i></strong> Find the tombs of the ancient guardians and awaken them to fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/e574ec788a8a048ede861508effa981b.poster.avif?t=1754610964\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/e574ec788a8a048ede861508effa981b.webm?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/e574ec788a8a048ede861508effa981b.mp4?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Split Ways:</i></strong> At a certain point, you must select a path that will determine the story's outcome and present various challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Mysteries of the Land:</i></strong> Uncover the reasons behind the war, the corrupting disease, and the origins and mysteries of the inhabitants through scattered notes, paintings, voiceovers, and other clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Your Story Ends in 3 Different Ways:</i></strong> There isn't just one way to conclude this story. Your actions and choices throughout your journey will determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/e831c8616f3f26f748d8141f13b745f6.poster.avif?t=1754610964\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/e831c8616f3f26f748d8141f13b745f6.webm?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/e831c8616f3f26f748d8141f13b745f6.mp4?t=1754610964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>An Unforgiving World</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asthenia is a challenging adventure game that doesn't offer mini-maps or quest markers. This means you'll need to rely on your observations and various tactics to progress, as the game doesn't hold your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ABOUT US</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am an Industry artist and the solo developer of Asthenia, which is my first game. I only recently had a new, Co-Dev join the project. I began working on this game in 2019, following some significant and devastating life events that inspired me to start this project. My goal was to develop a deeply personal story and interactive experience that explores both dark and hopeful themes within an immersive world. I hope you can find something meaningful and engaging to connect with in this game. Your feedback and opinions are highly valuable to me. Thank you for your support! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181660/extras/4ffa5e8e5eeed8991dcfd67a2f311887.avif?t=1754610964\" width=554 height=1500 /></span></p>",
